WEBVTT

00:11:59.715 --> 00:12:01.508
evokes a certain wistfulness.

00:12:03.886 --> 00:12:08.223
It has that quality
of a once-beloved melody

00:12:08.265 --> 00:12:10.476
whose notes now elude us.

00:12:11.143 --> 00:12:13.604
We are worried that if we sing the tune,

00:12:13.604 --> 00:12:16.106
it's going to land
just a bit flat in our time.

00:12:17.524 --> 00:12:18.776
And the reason is

00:12:19.818 --> 00:12:24.615
the foundational myth
of our political and economic systems

00:12:24.615 --> 00:12:29.411
that people will do only that
which is advantageous to them.